              "value": "Grisly Arrival"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(emotion, fear, mental)\n\nTrigger: The yeti hits a creature in the first round of combat and the yeti was hidden from that creature at the start of combat.\n\nEach enemy within 30 feet that witnesses the attack (including the target of the attack) must attempt a 23 Will save. On a failure, the creature is frightened 2; on a critical failure, it's frightened 4."
